  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>哥特式RPG字体</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">描述</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">您的游戏因这个哥特式和中世纪风格的字体而变得更加优质，易于阅读。专为<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> modpack设计，现已开放给公众使用！<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基于由Typodermic Fonts开发的<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffontmeme.com%252ffonts%252fvinque-font%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vinque</a> 字体。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字体受免费字体许可证授权。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/636/vinque-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截图（来自DarkRPG）</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/558/457/2022-12-19_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/558/458/2022-12-18_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即开设服务器与朋友一起游玩！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>或下方横幅并使用<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>代码享受25的折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:symbol;font-size:24px\">黑暗正在等待……</span></p>",
